==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
**3 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 0.67~2 seconds<sup>20f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use long-range attackers or cats that deal a lot of damage in a single hit ([[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat/Lizard Cat]] for example) to be able to knockback the Doge Darks to hinder them from moving forward. Continue spawning ranged attackers and the base will be open to attacks once you have killed enough of the Doge Darks.

